nhances the human experience and addresses pressing global challenges across the health sciences, engineering, social sciences, arts and humanities. VCU offers a dynamic, collaborative environment built to support researchers at every stage of their career, from emerging scholars to world-renowned principal investigators. Join a thriving research enterprise where your detail-oriented skills and expertise directly contribute to lasting societal impact. View a selection of research positions Postdoctoral Scholars We take pride in our deep commitment to our postdoctoral community. VCU was honored with a 2026 National Postdoctoral Association Institutional Policy Award in recognition of our transformative efforts to elevate quality of life and workplace equity for postdocs. Unlike many institutions across the country, VCU classifies our postdocs as fully-benefitted state employees. This means you receive full healthcare coverage, paid leave, annual cost-of-living adjustments and matching retirement benefits equal to 12-month faculty, allowing you to focus on career acceleration, innovation and discovery with total peace of mind. See what makes VCU the best workplace for postdocs Executive Roles The following roles are currently under recruitment by VCU's Executive Search Team and accepting applications: Associate Dean of Undergraduate Programs and Department Chair - School of Nursing Looking for a list of all open positions? Go back to the main job search page . Interested in learning more? Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) 9c9044ad Last Name (required) cc56af23 Email (required) 948af009 Resume (Optional) 50efb3a4 Accepted formats: PDF, DOC, DOCX, RTF, ODT, XML, DOT, PNG, GIF, JPG, JPEG, ZIP Job Alert ee1f11aa Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Employmen